  "limits": "One owned kind cluster with real Argo CD v3.5.3 and Flux. Shows that gitops settings reports what each Application, Kustomization and HelmRelease spec declares, that an absent field is unset and not off, that a kind the caller may not list is not read and not absent, and that a link is shown only when argocd-cm in the Application's namespace declares a url. Only guestbook-auto and the podinfo Kustomization are waited on to sync; the other objects exist to be read. The Application in team-b is not managed by this Argo CD, which is not configured for Applications in any namespace. It does not show that a controller acts on any setting, does not cover ApplicationSet-generated Applications, AppProject sync windows, per-resource sync-option annotations, the --tui viewport, or older Flux API versions, and makes no claim about agent cost."
